    rdfs:label "]\\\\ \\& \\& |[schemanode]| QualitySectionEntry tikzcd% Concrete instantiation of the Music factorization law with the Mittens body-mass observation: the raw observation is normalized to a typed quality claim, validated by the measurement shape gate, and rendered to the quality section entry.fig:music-mittens-factorization-concrete Diagram law (Figure~fig:music-mittens-factorization-concrete): the Mittens body-mass observation cannot jump directly from \\(MittensBodyMassObs\\) to \\(QualitySectionEntry\\); the full chain through normalization, validation, and rendering is required. The direct shortcut \\[ SourcePacket \\] is forbidden. In categorical form, every publication arrow \\[ p:SourcePacket \\] must factor as \\[ p=render. \\] The equation is the Music entry's core admissibility law. The rebuttal taxonomy packet is admitted by the same law. It is not a loose classification sentence; it is a source witness node with arrows: \\[ TaxonomyWitness selects Felis\\ catus/TSN\\ 183798 refines subclassOf D(type)=Cat. \\] The negative cases are also arrows, but forbidden ones: \\[ catus, TSN\\ 183798. \\] The page treats those failures as regressions because they collapse source leg, class bridge, and colimit apex into one label. disciplinebox[Node and arrow consequences] The engine's nodes name the things being governed: source packets, typed claims, shapes, tasks, manifests, traces, and page objects. Its arrows name the legal movement between them: normalizes, validates, schedules, emits, profiles, absorbs, and closes. If a sentence cannot be assigned to one of these roles, the sentence is not part of the engine. disciplinebox The olog reading follows. A local graph engine is a small category-like presentation whose objects are typed remediation artifacts and whose arrows are interpretation-preserving transformations. [0.88]% tikzcd[column sep=large,row sep=large,ampersand replacement=\\&] |[schemanode]| Manifest [r," .
